<title>USA: Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc Q1 oper net rises.</title>
<headline>Anheuser-Busch Cos Inc Q1 oper net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		   1996</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $0.51		    $0.47</p>
<p> Oper net		 258,000		  242,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,463,000		2,372,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     505,300		  519,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q1 excludes gain on sale of St. Louis Cardinals baseball team. Including gain, year-ago net income was $275.0 million or $0.53 a share on diluted basis.  </p>
<p>Revenues reflect net sales. Q1 1997 gross sales $2.86 billion vs $2.77 billion.</p>
<p>Q1 1997 primary earnings $0.51 a share vs $0.54 a year ago including Cardinal gain.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
